rd. But the path forward is full of deadly traps\u2026 and your one real ability? To fail.\n\nFortunately for you, there are mysterious orbs that let you leave a fragment of yourself behind. What remains will become barriers against hazards or platforms paving your way forward.\n\nFail and fail again, until you succeed! Persistence and clever thinking is the only way out of this place.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fail-fail-succeed"}